The formula says: for all vehicles and times, if (the vehicle is within 30 feet of a flashing signal, stop sign, yield sign, or traffic signal) AND (it is NOT the case that the vehicle's stop action is "stop" and the vehicle is stopped), then the vehicle must not be standing and must not be parked.

